{% comment %}
  Selection badge for a Bought Together row, sitting on the thumbnail's corner.
  Decorative — the real control is the visually hidden checkbox in the same
  label, so this is hidden from assistive tech and filled or hollow purely by
  the row's selected state.
{% endcomment %}
<span class="cwc_product-buy-box__fbt-tick" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" focusable="false">
    <path d="M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  </svg>
</span>
